        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "About Academy Vision in Pine Beach",
          "html": "About Academy Vision in Pine Beach",
          "id": "DdCSJNZ96O",
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’ve been in the area for a while, there’s a good chance you’ve heard of Academy Vision, or maybe you’ve even been here before. For decades, we’ve been taking care of families throughout the Jersey Shore, building relationships that last far beyond a single visit. And if you’re new to us, you’ll quickly see what keeps people coming back.</p>",
          "id": "bWaYLD2oDc",
          "origin": "static"
        }
      ]
