        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Continuing with Modern Vision Care",
          "html": "Continuing with Modern Vision Care",
          "id": "IiywFludnU",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Today, <a href=\"/hours-location/\">Academy Vision</a> continues to grow while staying true to what made it special in the first place. With new leadership and updated technology, we’re building on decades of experience to offer a more modern, elevated approach to eye care, without losing the personal, familiar feel our patients value.</p>",
          "id": "PXBLKAq5su",
          "col": 1,
